{"sourceUrl":"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/yxgcxy/info/1177/4645.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:28.455495+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/yxgcxy/info/1177/4645.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>河南医药大学</span></span><span><span>医学工程学院</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年优秀本科生科研夏令营招生简章</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为进一步促进高校优秀大学生间的交流互动，加强本学科与国内高水平大学相关院系的联系，进一步认识新医、了解新医，增进对</span></span><span><span>河南医药大学</span></span><span><span>医学工程学院的全面了解，为德才兼备、基础扎实、热爱科研、热爱本学科的优秀学生搭建继续深造平台。</span></span><span><span>河南医药大学</span></span><span><span>医学工程学院将于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span>1</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日举办</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>在夏令营期间，我院将组织开展知名教授学术讲座、研究生招生改革政策解读、学科与专业介绍以及师生互动等活动，激发学生们的科研兴趣，提升科研综合素养。具体安排如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>招生人数和报名</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>现面向全国高校招收营员</span>30<span>人，报名工作自即日开始，截止日期：</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>日，逾期不再接受申请。我院将根据报名情况和择优原则，确定入选学员名单，并于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日前通过</span>E-mail<span>或者电话通知入营名单，请关注邮箱并注意接听电话。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请对象条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）拥护党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）本科应为生物医学工程、电子信息、医学影像技术相关专业，有较强专业理论基础和良好科研能力</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>届毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）在校期间成绩优异，已在学术期刊上发表论文或获得大学生创新创业训练项目立项者优先。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、报名材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表（见附件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）身份证正反面扫描件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）外语水平证明（大学英语四级、六级考试）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）有关学术科研成果（发表论文、专利或参与科研项目情况等，论文提供封面及首页，没有可不提供）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）各类获奖、资格证书等体现自身学习和工作能力的材料（没有可不提供）。以上材料按顺序整理扫描后合并为一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，</span></span><a href=\"mailto:%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%90%8C%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%B7%E5%B0%86%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B6%E4%BB%A5\\%E2%80%9C%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D+%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1+%E5%A4%8F%E4%BB%A4%E8%90%A5%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0\\%E2%80%9D%E9%87%8D%E5%91%BD%E5%90%8D%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%8E2024%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%8810%E6%97%A5%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%86%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B61%E5%92%8C%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B62%E4%BB%A5%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E5%8C%85%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E8%87%B3171024@xxmu.edu.cn%E3%80%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>以</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校</span><span>+</span><span>夏令营材料名称</span><span>”</span><span>重命名，于</span></span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span>1</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>日前发送到</span>171024@xxmu.edu.cn<span>。</span></span></span></a><span><span>申请者应保证所有信息及提交材料的真实性、有效性和完整性，由材料不实造成的后果由本人自负。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、夏令营日程安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>本次夏令营活动采用线上形式开展，以腾讯会议为活动平台。申请参加的同学请准备好笔记本电脑（确保摄像头</span>+<span>麦克风正常使用），并提前安装、注册腾讯会议，熟悉腾讯会议室的使用方法，同时确保网络畅通、稳定。腾讯会议</span><span>ID</span><span>另行通知。具体活动内容如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）开营仪式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）学院领导介绍研究生招生和培养情况</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）各平台负责人介绍研究方向</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）知名教师讲授科研经验</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）各科研平台负责人与营员交流</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、注意事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）参加暑期夏令营的学生必须遵守</span></span><span><span>河南医药大学</span></span><span><span>的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动，并注意安全。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）如放弃，请在</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span>1</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日前及时联系学院。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>以梦为马，不期而遇。欢迎优秀的你参加</span></span><span><span>河南医药大学</span></span><span><span>医学工程学院</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年夏令营活动，我们在这里期待与你相遇！</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span>                                                    <span>医学工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                                                   <span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div><div></div>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>附件【<a href=\"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1598637418&amp;wbfileid=11983376\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1-2025年河南医药大学医学工程学院暑期夏令营申请表.doc</a>】已下载<span></span>次</li>\n<li>附件【<a href=\"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1598637418&amp;wbfileid=11983377\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">QQ群.jpg</a>】已下载<span></span>次</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n</div>","textSha256":"9666316aa2d0602130175189f10b267a513775881ed41966017a772fd9af506b","textLength":1192,"sourceSha256":"a54cce89c7396a0b336359359062458fde36257125bd3d8374b4256189b19651","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5e84a4097db3ed70170d","title":"2025年河南医药大学医学工程学院2025年优秀本科生科研夏令营招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:28.455495+00:00"}
